OL,3,GNEWSABaby flamingos hatch on Bank
OL,4,AHoliday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA growing flamingo family has rounded
OL,7,Foff "a lot of success" in an estate's
OL,8,Fbreeding programme.
OL,10,FSeven Chilean flamingo chicks have
OL,11,Fhatched over the last couple days at
OL,12,FLongleat, near Warminster and staff
OL,13,Fthere expect more to follow over the
OL,14,FBank Holiday weekend.
OL,16,FWhen they first hatch, they are white
OL,17,Fin colour as their signature pink
OL,18,Fdevelops as they grow up.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
