OL,3,GNEWSABaby flamingos hatch on Bank
OL,4,AHoliday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Beasley, head of animal
OL,7,Foperations, said: "It's fantastic to
OL,8,Fhave more new arrivals to round off the
OL,9,Fsummer season. We've seen lots of
OL,10,Fsuccess in our breeding programmes this
OL,11,Fyear."
